      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are carrying an unbearable weight, and the silence is deafening. Please, if you are feeling like you want to stop, know that there is a way to make this heavy feeling lift, and it doesn't have to be this way. You can reach out to someone right now; please call or text 988 to connect with the Suicide & Crisis Lifeline. They are available 24/7 to listen without judgment.",
